# Stand-in for the SoC series: vildangil's sm7435-smp-secondary.patch does not apply to xnu-10063.141.1
# (osfmk/arm64/start.s:145). These two are FFT-infra/UniXNU-sm8250-common 166235e (the SM8250 PAC-less ports,
# same OS profile): MAX_CPUS 8 with the Aff1 MPIDR match, and E/P clusters (A55 + A78 on ruan).
native-smp-secondary.patch
native-smp-type-clusters.patch
# The OS profile's zzz-boot-progress.patch needs the XNU_SHENG_PMGR block that only this patch creates
